    [Cherry-pick][releases/v0.30.0][BugFix][CI] Fix DeepSeek V4 Flash dataset path (from #18287) (#18288)
    
    Cherry-pick of PR #18287 onto `releases/v0.30.0`.
    
    Original PR: #18287
    Original author: @czydyy
    
    ---
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Fix the dataset directory typo in the daily and weekly DeepSeek V4 Flash
    performance case configurations (`DeekSeek` → `DeepSeek`). This allows
    the cases to find the intended input dataset.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. This only changes CI test configuration.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    - `git diff --check` passed.
    - Local pre-commit checks for spelling, typos, filenames, suggestions,
    and commit sign-off passed.
    - The end-to-end performance cases were not run locally because they
    require Ascend NPU hardware and the configured dataset.
    - The Gitleaks and symbolic-shape hooks could not run locally because
    this Windows environment lacks Bash and Python.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
